{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53370","headline":"诗偈 四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心若如，神自虚。\n不服药，病自除。\n病既除，自见莲华如意珠。\n无劳事，莫駈駈。\n智者观财色，了知如（《语录》作「是」）幻虚。\n衣食支身命，相劝学如如。\n时至移庵去，无物可盈余。\n（以上二首均见影印本日本花园大学图书馆藏高丽覆刻本南唐招庆寺静筠二僧着《祖堂集》卷十五）（按：《庞居士语录》卷中以後六句爲一首，似未全。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}